@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L2：messageId 生成复用 foundation-id

participant "MessageTemplate" as Template
participant "MessageEnvelopeEnricher\ncore.enrich" as Enricher
participant "MessageIdGenerator\nmessage domain SPI" as MsgIdGenerator
participant "FoundationMessageIdGenerator\ncore.id" as FoundationAdapter
participant "IdGenerator\nfoundation-component" as FoundationId
participant "MessageEnvelope" as Envelope

Template -> Enricher: enrich(envelope)
alt envelope 已有 messageId
  Enricher -> Enricher: 保留已有 messageId
else messageId 缺失
  Enricher -> MsgIdGenerator: nextId()
  MsgIdGenerator -> FoundationAdapter: delegate
  FoundationAdapter -> FoundationId: nextId()
  FoundationId --> FoundationAdapter: generated id
  FoundationAdapter --> MsgIdGenerator: String messageId
  MsgIdGenerator --> Enricher: messageId
  Enricher -> Envelope: set metadata.messageId
end
Enricher --> Template: enriched envelope

note over MsgIdGenerator,FoundationId
message-component 保留 MessageIdGenerator 领域接口，
默认实现委托 foundation-id，避免各技术组件重复发明 ID 体系。
end note
@enduml
